rown on you."]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"Water5","volume":100,"pitch":60,"pan":0}]},{"code":225,"indent":0,"parameters":[7,6,60,true]},{"code":355,"indent":0,"parameters":["$gameMap.event(2).setImage('$BigMonster2', 0);"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,1,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Something vast rises beside the Seeschwalbe, tentacles"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["and a beak, and on its back a knight in armour of black"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["water."]},{"code":355,"indent":0,"parameters":["$gameMap.event(3).setImage('Actor2', 0);"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Actor2",0,0,2,"Shigure"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The girl with the regalia. Kagerō said you would come"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["this way. He asked me to drown you gently."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["People4",5,0,2,"Kaizaki Rui"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Sixty men, Shigure. You drowned them one at a time."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Actor2",0,0,2,"Shigure"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Did I? I don't remember them. I am sorry. That is the"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["truth."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Hanma",0,0,2,"Hanma"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["A Calamity, my Lord. But four regalia: his rank will not"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["wall us out. Fight."]},{"code":301,"indent":0,"parameters":[0,128,false,false]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"Water4","volume":90,"pitch":60,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,1,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The Drowned Lance sinks to one knee on the kraken's back,"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["and the kraken sinks under him, and the sea goes flat."]},{"code":355,"indent":0,"parameters":["$gameMap.event(2).setImage('', 0);"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Actor2",0,0,2,"Shigure"]},{"code":401,"indent